{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a custom section:
    A 5-item horizontal carousel (five cards per row on desktop, slider on mobile).
    Each card contains:
    
    CARD LAYOUT
    
    Heading (text field) – Example: “Clear water is the foundation of wellness.”
    
    Influencer Name + Instagram icon with optional profile link.
    
    Video container using Wistia embed code (merchant will paste embed manually).
    
    Video controls needed:
    
    Mute/Unmute toggle button
    
    Play/Pause button
    
    Autoplay disabled unless user taps
    
    Second media field: Upload mobile-optimized image, shown only on mobile screens.
    
    Product title + optional product link below the video.
    
    SECTION REQUIREMENTS
    
    Support 5 blocks shown in one row on desktop (equal width cards).
    
    Convert automatically into a scrollable carousel on mobile.
    
    Each block should include:
    
    Heading (text)
    
    Influencer name (text)
    
    Instagram profile link (URL)
    
    Wistia embed code (textarea)
    
    Desktop thumbnail image
    
    Mobile image (shown only under 768px)
    
    Product name (text)
    
    Product link (URL)
    
    VIDEO BEHAVIOR
    
    Video only plays when clicked.
    
    Default state: muted + paused.
    
    When clicking play:
    
    Only the selected video plays
    
    All others pause
    
    Show overlay play button + mute icon.
    
    Mute/unmute button should switch Wistia player volume.
    
    DESIGN REQUIREMENTS
    
    Rounded corners (12px)
    
    Soft shadow
    
    Light background block
    
    Equal spacing between cards (20px)
    
    Use flexbox/grid for desktop row layout
    
    Smooth mobile scroll with snapping
    
    Typography similar to screenshot: bold heading, small influencer line, clean product name.
    
    OUTPUT FORMAT
    
    Generate:
    
    Liquid section file with schema
    
    HTML structure
    
    CSS for layout + responsive behavior
    
    JS for:
    
    Wistia embed initialization
    
    Play/Pause
    
    Mute/Unmute
    
    Pause all other videos when one plays, When a video is selected (clicked to play):
    
    ✔ The entire card background turns green (#D9F5E4 or similar soft green) — like the screenshot
    ✔ All other cards return to normal background
    ✔ Only the selected video's card should stay highlighted while playing
    ✔ When video is paused → green background removes
